   "Many producer, many consumer, thread-safe, runtime configurable buffer size.\nWhen buffer is empty, consumers suspend and are resumed by producers.\nWhen buffer is full, producers suspend and are resumed by consumers.",
   :source "std/Io.zig",
   :members
   [{:category :function,
     :zig-version "0.16.0",
