  {:zig-name "@import(\"std\").Io.Select",
   :documentation
   "Executes tasks together, providing a mechanism to wait until one or more\ntasks complete. Similar to Batch but operates at the higher level task\nabstraction layer rather than lower level Operation abstraction layer.\n\nThe provided tagged union will be used as the return type of the await\nfunction. When calling async or concurrent, one specifies which union field\nthe called function's result will be placed into upon completion.",
   :source "std/Io.zig",
   :members
   [{:category :type,
     :zig-version "0.16.0",
